{"id":"vod_sn_38824","vodId":"38824","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士Zi-O","name_cn":"假面骑士Zi-O","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8367a4b5ba2fdb401c29bec839191af8.jpg"},"summary":"《假面骑士Zi-O》（原文：仮面ライダージオウKamen Rider Zi-O）是2018年播出的日本特摄电视剧，也是“平成假面骑士”系列第20作，是“平成假面骑士”20周年的完结作品。Zi-O使用变身腰带“时空驱动器”，并装上变身道具“驾驭表头”变身。而且，能透过获得蕴藏着历代平成假面骑士力量的驾驭表头，将其力量解放，便能够穿上各平成骑士的装甲。这样，能够使用全部平成假面骑士力量的Zi-O，简直就是拥有从2000年开始“平成假面骑士”20部作品力量的超级英雄！自此，平成最后一位假面骑士的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":49,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s2HXcTuu5e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UZB3dqVjZH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yzt0sKQp3D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fwfMvvR96R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JNNNsUFw9m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ae8QfNeAHd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LfZ9UdxKmE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yZjdLjdNVw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v9L5WAvKEy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ENQMsrRjZ51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Wysqb8hTA31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uuX3RSSyDK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KVcXBptKs01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h7c7R0NbfS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.co